// Three kernels: rope_row (one row per 16 lanes), rope_pair (heads 2h, 2h+1 at the same s per 16 lanes,
// sharing one cos/sin load) and rope_quad (heads 2h, 2h+1 at positions 2s2, 2s2+1: four rows and two table
